11         * Purpose           : Macro that merges the Supplemental Qualifiers (SUPPQUAL or SUPP--)
12         *                      onto the parent domain for well-formed SDTM datasets.
13         *                     Refer to Supp2Par_v1.pdf for a complete description.
14         *
15         * Revision History  :
16         *
17         * Date        Author    Ref  Revision
